# Activity 5 B: L corner is physically perceived, not selected by an ID.
# Length and turn vary; the same pupil .wbb must adapt after real observations.
# The first boundary and far end are physically distinct; later evaluation must
# show repeated sensing and route-state utility without checking the pupil AST.
